{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1410177-what-should-a-modern-major-hermetic-chantry-look-like","id":1410177,"title":"What should a modern, major Hermetic Chantry look like?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-08-24T18:38:25-07:00","id":1410177,"title":"What should a modern, major Hermetic Chantry look like?","content":"Say you have a summoner who gets a spirit, perhaps a Djinn, to use his magic to build you a Chantry somewhere beneath the Mohave desert in the midst of a powerful Node. The Hermetics make it their main chantry in the region. What shape would it take? Perhaps some sort of college for one or two hundred Hermetic acolytes to keep the paradigm in check and groom potential apprentices? Spirits of various subjects, like physics and history, teaching classes? Shrines with gigantic, marble statues of Hermes, the Four Archangels, the Tarot Arcana, Gaia/The Triple Faced Goddess, and the planets of our solar system, and maybe the Muses along with any spirit that has an ongoing relationship with the Hermetic mages? Libraries, both one for the general students and one that contains dangerous knowledge? Obviously a warehouse for materials for Hermetic rituals. Any other ideas?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":986,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","user":"Mercurial","date":". 08-24-2020, 10:21 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-24T19:16:43-07:00","id":1410186,"title":"","content":"My personal tastes skew toward the design and decor of the house from Thirteen Ghosts, but I am weird.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-24T19:39:51-07:00","id":1410194,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mercurial</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1410177-what-should-a-modern-major-hermetic-chantry-look-like#post1410177\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Say you have a summoner who gets a spirit, perhaps a Djinn, to use his magic to build you a Chantry somewhere beneath the Mohave desert in the midst of a powerful Node. The Hermetics make it their main chantry in the region. What shape would it take? Perhaps some sort of college for one or two hundred Hermetic acolytes to keep the paradigm in check and groom potential apprentices? Spirits of various subjects, like physics and history, teaching classes? Shrines with gigantic, marble statues of Hermes, the Four Archangels, the Tarot Arcana, Gaia/The Triple Faced Goddess, and the planets of our solar system, and maybe the Muses along with any spirit that has an ongoing relationship with the Hermetic mages? Libraries, both one for the general students and one that contains dangerous knowledge? Obviously a warehouse for materials for Hermetic rituals. Any other ideas?</div> </div> </div> </div>I like your idea, but id totally rip off &quot;American Horror Story: Apocalypse&quot; by making it an underground bunker on top of a layline, using an entrance shaped like a laberyth<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn%3AANd9GcSNluG0p5xlcFgFMlpw_XfsOheAgYxVKcLo6Q&amp;usqp=CAU\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn%3AANd9GcSNluG0p5xlcFgFMlpw_XfsOheAgYxVKcLo6Q&amp;usqp=CAU\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn%3AANd9GcSNluG0p5xlcFgFMlpw_XfsOheAgYxVKcLo6Q&amp;usqp=CAU\" target=\"_blank\"> https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn%3AANd9GcSNluG0p5xlcFgFMlpw_XfsOheAgYxVKcLo6Q&amp;usqp=CAU </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://vignette.wikia.nocookie.net/americanhorrorstory/images/3/3d/Outpost_Three.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20180916023901\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://vignette.wikia.nocookie.net/americanhorrorstory/images/3/3d/Outpost_Three.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20180916023901\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://vignette.wikia.nocookie.net/americanhorrorstory/images/3/3d/Outpost_Three.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20180916023901\" target=\"_blank\"> https://vignette.wikia.nocookie.net/americanhorrorstory/images/3/3d/Outpost_Three.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20180916023901 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> id give it as many chambers as numerologically necesary.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-24T19:50:20-07:00","id":1410196,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crowley</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1410177-what-should-a-modern-major-hermetic-chantry-look-like?p=1410194#post1410194\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I like your idea, but id totally rip off &amp;quot;American Horror Story: Apocalypse&amp;quot; by making it an underground bunker on top of a layline, using an entrance shaped like a laberyth<br /> <br /> .</div> </div> </div> </div>Never saw it, I just want a place that you can create that won\u2019t be immediately spotted by Technocrat spy satellites. And rather than a labyrinth... did you ever read Courtney Crumrin when you were a kid? I\u2019m just thinking this would be an opportunity for the Hermetics to create their own mini version of Doissetep on Earth.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-27T04:23:26-07:00","id":1410649,"title":"","content":"I've seen a game where the local Hermetics built their own sub-chantry that, iirc, was a Nine Level Library. Each of the Traditions had access to their Sphere's level, and the Hermetics could go wherever they liked. It was built underground in a cliff-face. . . again, iirc. It was kind of like a Mini-Concordia.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Currently Hosting <a href=\"http://opx-finalfrontier.wikidot.com\" target=\"_blank\">Outpost Phoenix</a>, an Non-Affiliated, Live-Action Star Trek <a href=\"https://discord.gg/6zwnyzm\" target=\"_blank\">Discord</a> Sim. New players are always welcome!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11235-arzie","name":"Arzie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11235_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"88"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-27T09:34:41-07:00","id":1410698,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Arzie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1410177-what-should-a-modern-major-hermetic-chantry-look-like?p=1410649#post1410649\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've seen a game where the local Hermetics built their own sub-chantry that, iirc, was a Nine Level Library. Each of the Traditions had access to their Sphere's level, and the Hermetics could go wherever they liked. It was built underground in a cliff-face. . . again, iirc. It was kind of like a Mini-Concordia.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sounds neat! I think I want all of my common use libraries in the chantry to be shrines dedicated to Clio, the Muse of the Written Word. Each section of the chantry is going to be a shrine dedicated to a different Muse, Major Arcana spirit, Archangel, Hermes, or planetary spirit.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":986,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","user":"Mercurial","date":". 08-27-2020, 10:27 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-30T10:55:02-07:00","id":1411099,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>No One of Consequence</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1410177-what-should-a-modern-major-hermetic-chantry-look-like?p=1410186#post1410186\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My personal tastes skew toward the design and decor of the house from Thirteen Ghosts, but I am weird.</div> </div> </div> </div>That'd certainly make sense for a Hermetic barabbus ...<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1410-czernobog","name":"Czernobog","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}